    "summary": "The bolt pistol has Ballistic Skill 3+. On arrival by [Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike), [Servo-sentry](vsdata:ability/astra-militarum.tempestus-aquilons.servo-sentry) lets the Tempestor Aquilon fire its sentry weapon, whether that is the sentry hot-shot volley gun, sentry flamer or sentry grenade launcher. In your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), [Precision Drop](vsdata:ability/astra-militarum.tempestus-aquilons.precision-drop) lets them arrive more than 6″ away from every enemy unit, measured horizontally. Taking that closer placement makes them ineligible to [charge](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase) through the end of that turn.",
